"primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231223595", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020553622", "personaname": "Lord Poshname Von Plumbingparts", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198020553622/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 96, "playtime_forever": 305, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 305, "last_played": 1721545521, "avatar": "d3eb39d70f297a4191bea908797cd7972a77ad86"}, "language": "english", "review": "Took me two years to get a refund for the Biteback Edition from Bugthesda after a lot of back and forth.\r\n\r\nI could have saved myself a massive headache by not buying it in the first place but alas curiosity got the better of me.\r\n\r\nWhile the main game is still available on Steam I would recommend shoving wasps up your arse over buying this dog vomit of a game.", "timestamp_created": 1784920682, "timestamp_updated": 1784920682, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 47, "votes_funny": 23, "weighted_vote_score": "0.760338008403778076", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "hardware": {"system_ram": "64629", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 9 7950X3D 16-Core Processor          ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090", "vram_size": 24138}, "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 7}]}, {"recommendationid": "231223015", "author": {"steamid": "76561199886579525", "personaname": "codyjmonkey", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199886579525/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2315, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1063, "last_played": 1785772814, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game, i only have my game crash if i leave it on for more than an hour without moving but other than that its such a great game, amazing story, challenges you if you want it to challenge you, and cool abilities for the characters.", "timestamp_created": 1784920176, "timestamp_updated": 1784920176, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501018285751342773", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "231073508", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040523310", "personaname": "ferralese", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040523310/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6034, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2978, "last_played": 1786648999, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its fun because there are so many different ways to play it.", "timestamp_created": 1784752297, "timestamp_updated": 1784752297, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501018285751342773", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230908272", "author": {"steamid": "76561198349006347", "personaname": "devildaemon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198349006347/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 154, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7, "last_played": 1786708935, "avatar": "96740adfc230bdaf2008f954ea8d943b1f3fc37a"}, "language": "english", "review": "offline mode doesn't exist? it won't let me start the game just gets stuck trying to connect to non existent servers", "timestamp_created": 1784556409, "timestamp_updated": 1784556409, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 54, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.773859262466430664", "comment_count": 6, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230771346", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974968228", "personaname": "DadVRpro", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197974968228/", "num_games_owned": 157, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 1793, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 42, "playtime_at_review": 1509, "last_played": 1787189813, "avatar": "1b68a81b5d1f64f189ec85d61a6ae4547f1342d7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Redfall is a surprisingly fun single-player experience if you catch it at a discount. I played purely solo for about 25 hours, finished the main story, cleared out most of the side content, and knocked out the majority of the achievements.\r\nThe game plays a lot like a Far Cry title set in a vampire-infested town. The story kept me engaged (it’s good, not amazing), the world they built is atmospheric and interesting to explore, and the combat feels satisfying. Taking down vampires with different powers and weapons is genuinely fun, and the monster variety is solid. I played on the easiest difficulty, which made some fights a bit too easy, but it never ruined the enjoyment for me.\r\nThere are some bugs, especially during loading, and it looks like the co-op/online features are basically gone. That said, it stands up well as a single-player shooter.\r\nAt $19.99, this was absolutely worth the price. If you’re looking for a decent open-world shooter with vampires and don’t need multiplayer, I’d recommend grabbing it on sale. Solid 7/10.", "timestamp_created": 1784394486, "timestamp_updated": 1784394486, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.571145355701446533", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 34, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "230674621", "author": {"steamid": "76561199535036771", "personaname": "RositaTheMushroom", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199535036771/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1351, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 743, "playtime_at_review": 256, "last_played": 1788355193, "avatar": "fe1e6e60e29a43ff4988e1b8723607fbe999f0b6"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have already beaten the story before previously on xbox, im buying and playing it again! i really enjoy the story and the entire look of the game and when i played before i had never really played a shooty type game before but i have since played and beaten zombies cod bo6, saying that if you like games like cod zombies and other types i think you'll like this, it isn't round based but an open world. its honestly really fun just running and jumping around, it can definitely feel floaty but i enjoy it. really you should just buy the game and try it for yourself. trying new things is what life's about. 😊", "timestamp_created": 1784288399, "timestamp_updated": 1784288399, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501018285751342773", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230280836", "author": {"steamid": "76561198137875332", "personaname": "Thraellic S4", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198137875332/", "num_games_owned": 299, "num_reviews": 78, "playtime_forever": 6985, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5868, "last_played": 1785431019, "avatar": "cf4e76e6c3c05687b26d3dcb15bad9dcb10df459"}, "language": "english", "review": "Update: switching off DLSS cured ALL the crashing.  And I can't see any downgrade in quality.\n\nCall me crazy, but I really love this game.  Played it on gamepass, now playing a second time on Steam.  These devs had something special.\n\nYes, I had to create a Bethesda account, which sucks, but thankfully it works fine Offline for me.  And yes, it crashes fairly often.  Not enough to deter me (yet) because there's nothing else I want to play more than this right now.  \n\nIt's like action-Dishonered.  I like Dishonered but this just feels more fun.  If Dishonered is your strict and sour college professor, this game is your tripped out of their skull dorm roommate.  It's also nothing like Dishonered, so there.  This studio made one of my top 3 of all time games, Prey, and it's also nothing like that.  So there.", "timestamp_created": 1783845486, "timestamp_updated": 1785052313, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.560953974723815918", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "hardware": {"system_ram": "15587", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 9 7940HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics     ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Laptop GPU", "vram_size": 7948}, "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 32, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "229999831", "author": {"steamid": "76561199833818587", "personaname": "JenAn17m ♡", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199833818587/", "num_games_owned": 64, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 2834, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1244, "last_played": 1784584467, "avatar": "77af09681d16df814f5488360b08c18617eeac03"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1783572829, "timestamp_updated": 1783572829, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.479277372360229492", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229838611", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997168342", "personaname": "Blakington", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/McKuller/", "num_games_owned": 779, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 507, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 507, "last_played": 1783348275, "avatar": "db1382126b55a2709386f99d0727732927d42cd2"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's just not good.", "timestamp_created": 1783419526, "timestamp_updated": 1783419526, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47999998927116394", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31896", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080", "vram_size": 15977}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229504006", "author": {"steamid": "76561198149262796", "personaname": "Brozenheim", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/brozenheim/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 2606, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 22, "playtime_at_review": 1833, "last_played": 1787799084, "avatar": "23b206f86e40182f1ea67d0f2fe9cd2521cf1e18"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is probably a wildly unpopular opinion, but I LOVE this game. Such a meticulously well-crafted world. Fun enemies that present an actual challenge, at time. The calling cards of the great Arkane Austin (Dishonored, Prey) are all here - dark narrative flourishes, fun, effective abilities, a surrealistic art style, maps full of new guns to grab and items to get. There were some issues at launch - the maps were mostly empty of enemies and I don't think they would respawn. You had to work to find enough battles to keep it interesting. Still, I could see that it had good bones.\r\n\r\nThe game was rushed, insufficiently promoted, then abandoned, after Microsoft acquired the studio. The last patch fixed a lot of the issues that were there at launch and now I find it to be my second favorite Arkane Austin game, after the original Dishonored.\r\n\r\nThis is a shout out to all of the Arkane Austin crew who made this happen. Thank you! I'm sorry about what happened to y'all. Your work is appreciated!", "timestamp_created": 1783088192, "timestamp_updated": 1783088192, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 18, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.631695687770843506", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 25, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 32, "count": 1}]}]}